{"v":4,"catch":"翱翔，自由落體，征服天空！","desc":"高空跳傘提供極致的腎上腺素飆升體驗，讓自由落體和精確著陸的刺激觸手可及。從高處跳水，在真實的風動力中進行機動，並在令人驚嘆的地點掌握大膽的特技。\n\n客製化您的裝備，參加跳傘挑戰，並在完善您的技能時解鎖新的高度。無論您是追求完美著陸還是探索開闊天空的自由，這款模擬器都能為您帶來終生難忘的冒險體驗。\n\n您準備好踏出這一步了嗎？天空正在等待！","publisher":"Play Lab","release":"2024-12-19","genres":["模擬","動作","街機","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.5GB / Switch 1.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/165c293e94e31e9bba6fd8676e9203291ca8510fb78e271b45dc1d7d3c2375c7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f9264cab1dfba49c9f8941316a29020c2cbe651e6d036d8824a8d93360527c9d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d79b24c30a0274cefd2c8409447e79f2d60d4ee927c189a3a1ed4c219f5f3e55.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/426cce8d2cd9f281b2e2c4b618980601e6d91ab8d59c00cda43334c0aee0740d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6d411b87fd47b60835d13eede6ca22c57a0b0bb773fca73f45acdbf4be29ca1a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c761736ce98276bf0b505cb892cf13ef2afd9b7f7e853f833cf55bdbaea72fb4.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b24021540000","dlc":[]}